{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32958","headline":"和人听歌 二 · 崔珏","name":"和人听歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红脸初分翠黛愁，锦筵歌板拍清秋。\n一楼春雪和尘落，午夜寒泉带雨流。\n座上美人心尽死，尊前旅客泪难收。\n莫辞更送刘郎酒，百斛明珠异日酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}